==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Mr. Angel]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*6 [[Mr. Angel]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Sunfish Jones]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Zir Zeal]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
**10 [[Mr. Angel]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**4 [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 30~33.33 seconds<sup>900f~1,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The only enemy of note here is the single Zir Zeal that spawns on base hit, and Holy Blast is able to deal with it nicely. More basic attacking units are able to deal with the unburrowed Zeal much more easily and should be able to clean up the Heavenly Hippoes and Mr. Angels. Sunfish Jones does not push.

